    "R-STRING-1",
    "D-STRING-1",
    "II-02"
  ],
  "description": "OR-WIRE read-back of fixture r-wire-sql (route sql): reopened read-only through DAO, one snapshot per column of W (SELECT ID, column FROM W WHERE ID BETWEEN base AND base+99 ORDER BY ID); for each, every Field Name/Type/Size/Attributes, then every row's Field.Value read once by ordinal. Asks, per cell, whether the row exists and its VARIANT tag, exact bits, BSTR byte length and payload, array bytes. Cells: FByte (IDs from 100): ui1-0, ui1-255, i2-256, i2-minus1, r8-1.5, r8-2.5; FInt (IDs from 200): i2-min, i2-max, i4-32768, i4-minus32769, r8-1.5, r8-2.5; FLong (IDs from 300): i4-min, i4-max, r8-2147483648, r8-minus2147483649, r8-0.5, r8-1.5, r8-2.5; FSingle (IDs from 400): plus-zero, minus-zero, min-subnormal, max-subnormal, min-normal, max-finite, plus-inf, minus-inf, qnan, qnan-payload, snan, negative-qnan, r8-1e39, r8-1e-50, r8-0.1; FDouble (IDs from 500): plus-zero, minus-zero, min-subnormal, max-subnormal, min-normal, max-finite, plus-inf, minus-inf, qnan, qnan-payload, snan, negative-qnan, one-plus-ulp, r4-0.1-widened, r8-0.1; FCurr (IDs from 600): cy-min, cy-max, cy-0.0001, cy-minus-0.0001, r8-0.00005, r8-0.00015, r8-1e15, bstr-5-decimals; FDate (IDs from 700): oa-0, oa-min, oa-max, below-min, above-max, negative-1.5, negative-0.25, positive-1.5, one-millisecond, half-second, nan, plus-inf, r8-tag-1.5, bstr-iso; FText (IDs from 800): empty, ascii, bmp, nul-middle, nul-only, astral, lone-high, lone-low, reversed-pair, u-fffe, odd-1-byte, odd-3-bytes, odd-3-bytes-high, len-255, len-256; FMemo (IDs from 900): empty, nul-middle, lone-high, lone-low, odd-1-byte, odd-5-bytes, len-300, len-5000, astral-4000, odd-8001-bytes; FBin (IDs from 1000): empty, leading-zeros, all-zero, ramp-255, ramp-256, bstr-ab, bstr-odd-3-bytes, hex-literal; FOle (IDs from 1100): empty, leading-zeros, ramp-256, pattern-5000, bstr-ab, bstr-odd-3-bytes; FBool (IDs from 1200): true, false, i2-1, i2-2, i2-minus1, r8-0.5, bstr-True, bstr-0, ui1-255; FDec (IDs from 1300): bstr-1.5, bstr-minus-0.0001, bstr-14.4-digits, bstr-28-digits, bstr-29-digits-max, bstr-trailing-zero, bstr-negative-zero, cy-1.5, r8-0.1, i4-7",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
    "clearErrorInfoBefore",
    "excepinfo",
    "deferredFill",
    "errorInfo"
  ],
